{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "87364a17-1c7f-8ebb-92e3-30d2d9902132",
  "created_at": "2026-02-02T12:26:40-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Vincent Iannuccilli",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:23:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:23:16-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, hello. Um, I am calling about a noise problem. A party, a loud party. Can you hear me okay? I am on my cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:23:27-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you, a little choppy. Go ahead, and I'll tell you if I lose you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:23:34-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thank you. So there is a rental house near me, and they have a loud party. Music, people yelling in the yard. Until two in the morning. Two, yes, two a.m."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:23:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Until two in the morning. And was that last night?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:23:52-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Last night, and Saturday also. It has been going on since the weekend. Friday, I think, was a little bit, but Saturday and Sunday were bad. [line breaks up] so that is three nights, almost."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:24:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, you broke up there for a second. Did you say Saturday and Sunday were the bad nights?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:24:14-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes. Saturday and Sunday. Sorry, the signal is not good. Thank you for checking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:24:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. What's the address of the house having the party?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:24:25-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I am at 43 Dixon Street, in the North End. The party house is right next to us. Same street. 43 Dixon, that is where I am, so I can hear everything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:24:38-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, so you're at 43 Dixon Street, and it's the rental house beside you. Let me make sure I have that right. Forty-three Dixon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:24:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, forty-three, correct. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:24:51-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And I'll take down your name too, if that's alright."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:24:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Vincent Iannuccilli. I-A-N-N-U-C-C-I-L-L-I. And my number is 401-555-0182."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:25:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Vincent, four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-two. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:25:04-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is right. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:25:07-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I'll write this up as a noise complaint for that address."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:25:12-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Um, can I ask, should I call the police non-emergency line instead? Because it is already the third night. Maybe that is faster, no?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:25:22-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For a party that's going on while it's happening, yes, the police non-emergency line is the quicker way to get someone out there. What I can do here is log the complaint so there's a record of the pattern."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:25:37-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so tonight, if it starts again, I call the police. And you keep the record. Yes? [crosstalk]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:25:45-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, that's it. Sorry, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:25:48-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you go. I was just saying, it is a problem because my son has basketball practice at six in the morning. I have to arrange a ride for him, and then he is tired, I am tired. So I cannot keep doing this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:26:05-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a rough stretch, with practice that early. I'll put in the note that it's been three nights running and that it's keeping your household up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:26:16-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, thank you. That helps. So, to check: you log it, and I call police when it is loud. That is all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:26:25-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all of it. Someone may follow up with you at the number you gave me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:26:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Good. Thank you very much, Owen. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:26:37-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Vincent. Take care."
    }
  ],
